            <pubDate>Sat, 07 Nov 2026 08:17:57 +0000</pubDate>
            <sparkle:channel>beta</sparkle:channel>
            <sparkle:version>143</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.6.14</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>26.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[### New
- **Sessions in the sidebar.** Each project lists its In Progress tasks that have a session, with a status dot and the time since the agent's last activity. Click a row to open its terminal, click the project to go back to its board. Up to 5 rows per project; the arrow folds them away, and clicking a folded project opens them again.
- **Session info line.** Below the terminal header: the first line of the agent's last message, plus model, turns, tokens and cost when the provider reports one.

### Fixed
- Choosing a task in the command palette no longer leaves the next sheet, such as Task Details, unable to appear.
]]></description>
